# The mediacore.audit scope's series (05-rbac §11): family<TAB>type<TAB>labels,
# checked by metricstest.AssertSeries in TestAuditSeries_Golden. The families
# are observable instruments over the store's counters; audit_pruned_total
# stays 0 until the tasks flip registers core.audit.prune.
mediacore_audit_dropped_total	counter	
mediacore_audit_pruned_total	counter	
mediacore_audit_queue_depth	gauge	
mediacore_audit_records_total	counter	namespace,outcome
mediacore_audit_write_errors_total	counter	path
